# Nested fn: inner fn captures root-scope builtin (+) not captured by outer fn.
# Exercises creation_dict_count via fn_scope_boundaries.first() (outermost fn boundary),
# the specific code path fixed in the resolve.rs cascade else branch.
[make-adder: [fn [let n]
               [fn [let x] [+ n x]]]
 add10: [make-adder 10]
 result: [add10 5]]
.result
=== out
15
